🔹5 ish kunida ishlovchilar 4 kun dam oladi:

29-avgust – (shanba) dam olish kuni;
30-avgust – (yakshanba) dam olish kuni;
31-avgust – (dushanba) qo'shimcha dam olish kuni;
1-sentabr – (seshanba) bayram; 

🔹6 ish kunida ishlovchilar 3 kun dam oladi:

30-avgust – (yakshanba) dam olish kuni;
31-avgust – (dushanba) qo'shimcha dam olish kuni;
